  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/IMG_0714.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(14 fotos) La r&aacute;pida intervenci&oacute;n de los bomberos voluntarios del parque Espad&aacute;n Mijares ha impedido la noche de este mi&eacute;rcoles que el fuego que se ha iniciado en una finca de cultivo abandonado llegara a las primeras casas del Tossalet en la calle Montserrat II, las m&aacute;s cercanas al barrio de la Moreria.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/IMG_0737.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El inciendio se ha iniciado hacia las 22.45 horas y hasta all&iacute; han acudido tambi&eacute;n r&aacute;pidamente la Guardia Civil y la Polic&iacute;a Local, que ha mantenido en alerta al vecindario por si hab&iacute;a que evacuarlo. S&iacute; que han trasladado unos animales que hab&iacute;a en un corral junto a los terrenos quemados.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0714.jpg\" alt=\"img_0714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0722.jpg\" alt=\"img_0722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0723.jpg\" alt=\"img_0723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0724.jpg\" alt=\"img_0724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0727.jpg\" alt=\"img_0727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0730.jpg\" alt=\"img_0730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0731.jpg\" alt=\"img_0731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0734.jpg\" alt=\"img_0734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0737.jpg\" alt=\"img_0737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0739.jpg\" alt=\"img_0739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0741.jpg\" alt=\"img_0741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0742.jpg\" alt=\"img_0742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0743.jpg\" alt=\"img_0743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendicostattossalet/img_0744.jpg\" alt=\"img_0744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
